      "name": "Work status",
      "description": "Actual stage, elapsed seconds, and process grouping while preserving access to the current document.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-working\" role=\"status\"><div class=\"ds-status-line\"><span class=\"ds-spinner\"></span><strong>Analista e Insights están trabajando</strong><time>32s</time></div><ol class=\"ds-steps\" aria-label=\"Proceso de la solicitud\"><li><span></span>Intención</li><li><span></span>Datos</li><li data-state=\"active\"><span></span>Informe</li></ol><small>Sigo trabajando. El informe actual permanece disponible.</small></div>",
      "css": ".ds-working{display:block;padding:14px;background:var(--input,#242424);color:var(--text,#ededed);border:1px solid var(--line,#303030);border-radius:8px;margin:10px 0 18px;font:400 13px/1.5 \"Segoe UI\",system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-status-line{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:9px}.ds-status-line strong{font-size:12px;font-weight:500;flex:1}.ds-status-line time{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted,#a4a4a4);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-spinner{margin-top:2px;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;border:1.5px solid var(--line,#303030);border-top-color:var(--text,#ededed);display:inline-block;animation:ds-spin 1s linear infinite;flex:none}@keyframes ds-spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}.ds-steps{list-style:none;display:flex;gap:14px;padding:0;margin:14px 0 9px;font-size:10px}.ds-steps li{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;color:var(--muted,#a4a4a4)}.ds-steps li>span{width:5px;height:5px;border:1px solid var(--muted,#a4a4a4);border-radius:50%}.ds-steps li[data-state=\"active\"]{color:var(--text,#ededed)}.ds-steps li[data-state=\"active\"]>span{background:var(--text,#ededed);border-color:var(--text,#ededed)}.ds-working>small{display:block;font-size:10px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted,#a4a4a4)}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-spinner{animation:none}}",
      "refersTo": "work-status"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Analysis Desk",
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** introduce a chromatic accent into the monochrome workspace shell.",
      "**Don't** turn flat workspace panes into a collection of raised cards.",
      "**Don't** reuse the mobile drawer shadow on permanent desktop surfaces.",
      "**Don't** promote surface-specific large headings or the existing text-glyph\n  error dismiss control into reusable display or icon primitives.",
      "**Don't** substitute an elapsed timer or ready graphics for a promise of\n  exhaustive analysis or a fixed completion time."
